{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8001_p", "source_sha256": "57f1f7c7dd357f698317f82ba440bee172463c77f4fdce89759f6b58c0f61874", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\n茜は『取り調べを行う警察官』をテーマに撮影する）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，\n茜以“负责审讯的警察”这一主题进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8002_023aka", "source_sha256": "4d7533f6cf5a1353b048a2e64598bda742c20d1a62e22c77ba84c173a031b3d3", "ja": "茜ちゃんと警察官なんて……\n新たな魅力がまた開花しちゃうねっ！", "zh": "和小茜一起当警察什么的……新的魅力又要绽放了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8003_023aka", "source_sha256": "0fa3eec7848316466d6f61736af95c6bccc6debb545d53a6f0c1667846173a3c", "ja": "見えるよ、茜ちゃんには！　茜ちゃんの眩しさに、\n誰もが罪を認めてしまう場面が！", "zh": "我能看到，小茜能看到！　被小茜耀眼的光芒一照，\n所有人都会认罪的场面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8004_p", "source_sha256": "95b3edf75e9c8c490e74782c9792f54ee17cb4c3cb87f874751cad734fb2e83a", "ja": "取り調べはそんなに簡単なものじゃないぞ。\n相手には黙秘権もあるからな。", "zh": "审讯可没那么简单哦。\n对方也是有沉默权的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8005_023aka", "source_sha256": "c1eb410b4a78d548796de4b536406f889dd273e453946165e33fccdbd1dee193", "ja": "むむ……。じゃあじゃあ、どんなふうに取り調べたら、\n茜ちゃんの魅力で相手を落とせると思う？", "zh": "唔唔……那你说说看，要怎么审讯，\n才能用小茜的魅力把对方攻陷呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8006", "source_sha256": "a83883dc1353351f6898151161ecc1af3196b49633fa60ebf7fc9df1f4ea4247", "ja": "優しく", "zh": "温柔地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8007", "source_sha256": "6c36b461a8fadaf035b26167701b60af5cb24e209cabc385a242ab60627b9bc0", "ja": "厳しく", "zh": "严格地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8008", "source_sha256": "c433ac97220ad171ffe09eb9ae40e9ad677de70e4047e4823a6ce5164490e227", "ja": "猫のごとく", "zh": "如猫一般", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8100_p", "source_sha256": "9b9ee0fc32fb80f23db9a938b6da555af4d56d62068e312bac87df101934e1ad", "ja": "優しく取り調べるのはどうだ？　相手も油断して\n本当のことを話してくれるかもしれない。", "zh": "温和地盘问一下怎么样？对方或许会放松警惕，把真话说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8101_023aka", "source_sha256": "65cc2c5dc52068ccea10e0dc254c49d8613afb1ab5ae5b90b6eb1faaa0e46453", "ja": "茜ちゃんの優しさでノックアウトするってことだね！\nそれなら簡単簡単～！　朝飯前だよ！", "zh": "也就是说，要用小茜的温柔把对方彻底击倒吧！\n那就简单简单～！小菜一碟哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8102_023aka", "source_sha256": "1e049541ec1d9f97468ab6eea2951203377c26e5eb64981d54c87870c9b71eca", "ja": "まずは{$P$}ちゃんを、やさしーく\n落としちゃうから、覚悟してねっ♪　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "首先就用超～温柔的手段把{$P$}拿下，\n做好心理准备吧♪ 喵哈哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8200_p", "source_sha256": "70f67eaced9cfda638979c3478123f26c7455c325d9665362eeb00ec49c221d0", "ja": "厳しい取り調べが、一般的なイメージに近いかもな。\nどんな相手にも怯まない強さで圧倒するんだ。", "zh": "严厉的审问，或许更接近一般印象吧。\n要用面对任何对手都毫不畏惧的坚强气势压倒对方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8201_023aka", "source_sha256": "21b4486ebfd882fa6cf42e0cdad289ce81a3577d8d40ee2ece41739dcd40dab7", "ja": "なるほど～。茜ちゃんのキリッとした表情を見せるわけ\nだね。ほほう、{$P$}ちゃん……。", "zh": "原来如此～。也就是说，要展现出小茜那副帅气利落的表情吧。哦哦，{$P$}呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8202_023aka", "source_sha256": "62c7f4d99b426299daeee2e4648795183097b4922fcb987f73ecc2a80bf6bee1", "ja": "ギャップでドキドキさせちゃおう大作戦とは、\nなかなか考えるね～。その作戦、後でやってみるね♪", "zh": "用反差感让人心跳加速大作战，真亏你想得出来呢～这个作战，之后我也要试试看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8300_p", "source_sha256": "1d68ffc252fcbba4378103f15e195c8d2130fb76c9f4fa46fd478d5a65f0f2f8", "ja": "猫のように気まぐれな言動で翻弄するのはどうだ？\n相手も動揺して、口を滑らせるかもしれない。", "zh": "要不要用像猫一样捉摸不定的言行让对方不知所措？\n对方也许会因此慌乱，说漏嘴也说不定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8301_023aka", "source_sha256": "47da85d9c1064e7058356f1d1871841401eb3e380cab08b09f3b02e1b0a889cc", "ja": "ふっふっふ、そういうことなら茜ちゃんにお任せっ☆\nでもでも、ひとつだけ心配があって～。", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿，既然这样就交给小茜吧☆  \n不过不过，有一件事让我有点担心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_8302_023aka", "source_sha256": "a6c685632f928633700e439d24c8f03b6d0cba95c9861f34dfb2dde0686776cd", "ja": "茜ちゃんの猫カワイイ姿に、ガチ恋されないかな？\nそれだけが、とっても気がかりだよ……。", "zh": "会不会有人因为小茜那副可爱的猫咪模样而真的爱上她啊？\n我就只担心这一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
